        {
          "title": "Creating Feeds",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Create feeds for either delivering your Plans or to start continuously sharing information.</li>\n<li>Tap the <strong>Feed symbol</strong> to start.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c09ee1fb0e31cfa8.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "The Datasync Home - Overlay Manager",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Datasync home shows all the present feeds in the servers you are connected to.</li>\n<li>Hit the <strong>Plus symbol</strong> to create a new Feed.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5f8b389b72416f9b.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Creating a Feed",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tap <strong>Create feed.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a7ccff6cbe91f629.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Creating Feed - Options",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>First we want to name your new feed.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4c13e87fa2d1086e.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name your Feed",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Be descriptive. The example name points out that the feed contains your plan for the FRAGO3 Order.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/25d8adf32e029005.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Choose Default Role",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Next, tap the Default Role selector to choose who can access your Feed.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b860b25fc7d71850.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Feed Default Access",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Choose what best suites your purposes.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/7c5ef679f81f228b.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Describe your Feed",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>By hitting Description, you may describe your feed a bit. That helps.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ccae7c9da23020d6.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Hashtags",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Optionally, you could write some hashtags for your feed. That could help in analyzing data on your server.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e5b817603ea67a6e.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "New Feed Created!",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Your new feed is now here!</li>\n<li>If the default role is not Admin, people from your server can now subscribe your feed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>After successful testing Create &#x26; Manage Feeds, continue to <a href=\"/doc/2676ebbb-83f4-4569-a7a2-7050395f28c8\">Draw &#x26; share Plans</a></p>\n<p>Korjataan Data Sync Default Role Owner kuvaus:\\nKäyttäjästä tulee oletuksena Admin Data Sync feedille. Tätä ominaisuutta ei suositella käytettäväksi, uusi omistaja voi</p>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Confirm in the Data Sync List",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Reopen Data Sync. Your new feed now appears in the list with its callsign and item count.</li>\n<li>Tap the <strong>eye icon</strong> beside it to toggle visibility on the map.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c53a9f2ed53348e3.webp",
              "width": 250,
              "height": 197
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
